msgid ""
"函数仅收到训练集，返回有限维线性模型 weights 与 bias。评测端在独立留出集重算 "
"MSE 与 MAE，同时满足各场景阈值才通过；不采信自报分数。"
msgstr "The function receives training data only and returns a finite-dimensional linear model with weights and bias. The evaluator recomputes MSE and MAE on separate held-out data. Both scenario thresholds must be met; self-reported scores are ignored."

msgid ""
"返回参数和已知绝对观测误差下的协方差。参数容差为绝对 1e-8、相对 1e-7；协方差"
"按各参数标准差尺度使用绝对 1e-8、相对 1e-7；白化正规方程残差须不超过 1e-5。模"
"型卡方诊断与解法正确性分开显示。"
msgstr "Return parameters and covariance for known absolute observation errors. Parameter tolerances are 1e-8 absolute and 1e-7 relative; covariance uses a standard-deviation-scaled absolute tolerance of 1e-8 and a relative tolerance of 1e-7. The whitened normal-equation residual must not exceed 1e-5. Model chi-square diagnostics are displayed separately from solution correctness."

